     6	## Headline
     7	
     8	**Ensemble of Direct VLM + V6.5 ReAct agent gives +4.52pp on Qwen3.5
     9	test** (0.7684 → 0.8136, 12-domain macro AUROC, n=1418). The V8
    10	"refutation agent" gives +3.3pp on dev but only +1.3pp on test,
    11	revealing that ensemble gain is primarily driven by **score
    12	distribution diversity**, not by the agent's deliberation protocol.
    13	
    14	## Full result table (Qwen3.5-VL-27B)
