    52	{\footnotesize $^{*}$ $P(\Delta{>}0){\geq}0.95$; $^{***}$ $P(\Delta{>}0){=}1.000$; $^\dagger$ GPT-5.4 v8 numbers are dev-only ($n{=}480$) because the sub2api endpoint repeatedly rate-limited v8's test-scale concurrency. See \S\ref{ssec:score_diversity} for the score-distribution analysis that explains the v6-vs-v8 ensemble gap.}
